{"title":"2003 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many perfect squares are divisors of the product <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/f/18fba907d4f901c083e61f03152d8c846c495739.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1! \\cdot 2! \\cdot 3! \\cdot \\hdots \\cdot 9!$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"128\" height=\"13\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/7/7673d0f0de83d9a1351a0f2bdf66578a2195352d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 504\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 672\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 864\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 936\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 1008$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"448\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We want to find the number of perfect square factors in the product of all the factorials of numbers from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/8/8a8c4507655b839f4f624f81e3b12ca3b6dfe2a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 - 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />. We can write this out and take out the factorials, and then find a prime factorization of the entire product. We can also find this prime factorization by finding the number of times each factor is repeated in each factorial. This comes out to be equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/a/5ea5a6a10a10b3d80a1960823cbfd05a00b5af48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{30} \\cdot 3^{13} \\cdot 5^5 \\cdot 7^3$\" width=\"117\" height=\"15\" />. To find the amount of perfect square factors, we realize that each exponent in the prime factorization must be even: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/4/8b44aed3bbfca463b48300e6c2462b3a35e68aa7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{15} \\cdot 3^{6}\\cdot 5^2 \\cdot 7^1$\" width=\"110\" height=\"15\" />. To find the total number of possibilities, we add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to each exponent and multiply them all together. This gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/0/d00c37f69d3901429df466d499540b63253346a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16 \\cdot 7 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 2 = 672$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"135\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/5/c85fa79f94f23a676629b9742ac5fc3c3773a144.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow\\boxed{\\mathrm{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"62\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>(Explanation of 1)\n</p><p>Factorials up to 9 in product lead to prime factorization <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/c/53c3c50502c75f87675985d8a89d92d0f397d345.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{30}$\" width=\"21\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/4/1e4bb5c0261c8d726157108cdd95cf6eb7bb6d46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$*$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/1/fe1d889d1c902300bc09bec1ea22846a66bc6907.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{13}$\" width=\"21\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/4/1e4bb5c0261c8d726157108cdd95cf6eb7bb6d46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$*$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/1/0e1baff6050db5d3e78ff320d0358d74adf9b153.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/4/1e4bb5c0261c8d726157108cdd95cf6eb7bb6d46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$*$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/9/bd99228146175c61e5cca6be965d17c918d45cec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^3$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> So the number of pairs possible is { <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/6/d461a03c629720cfd53171c56b9318dd10351ecf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{0}$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/9/d198e115ee5481f6012df3f623690b4bcab5f869.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"4\" height=\"5\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/2/df290664cf90881dec7ee8d27f6da0910eb8f1fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/9/d198e115ee5481f6012df3f623690b4bcab5f869.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"4\" height=\"5\" /> ... <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/c/53c3c50502c75f87675985d8a89d92d0f397d345.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{30}$\" width=\"21\" height=\"15\" /> }{ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/8/e782613426a53e4e1b68656d409a03bfe3dad499.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{0}$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/9/d198e115ee5481f6012df3f623690b4bcab5f869.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"4\" height=\"5\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/a/65a8d9b91dd72c8f11e02c75672fe7a880a3ac21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{2}$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/9/d198e115ee5481f6012df3f623690b4bcab5f869.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"4\" height=\"5\" /> ... <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/1/eb1b6f7da71bb26924fd437223715da5f12c4d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{12}$\" width=\"21\" height=\"15\" /> }{ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/f/4effdac3e1828c67e93a16c52d50d5e885af0313.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{0}$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/9/d198e115ee5481f6012df3f623690b4bcab5f869.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"4\" height=\"5\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/1/2b1820deed69da37d7cffb93dec8d3ff6c0c95ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{2}$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/9/d198e115ee5481f6012df3f623690b4bcab5f869.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"4\" height=\"5\" /> ... <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/6/ec625f8e70794239492606db42645451e2978e0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{4}$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> }{ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/5/3250f0398180d535f2fa52847b9a48740ac7bedd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^{0}$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/9/d198e115ee5481f6012df3f623690b4bcab5f869.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"4\" height=\"5\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/d/fbdcc0716b46d83a432290bb55a628746e2598d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^{2}$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> }\n</p><p>Which leads to resulting number of pairs = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/6/766ed5a841725c8dbb3c590958409d5fc68ed126.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16*7*3*2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"96\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/e/d5eb8726a34932d28103ce7ce17456421222603f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/2/3a21eedf8987958dc8173f6c266f7c4dafde16b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$672$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/5/c85fa79f94f23a676629b9742ac5fc3c3773a144.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow\\boxed{\\mathrm{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"62\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A\">2003 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a 